O9851 (TOOL LENGTH ON THE TOOL SETTER - CNC TWIN BUILT-IN SETTER MACRO)
(T: LENGTH OFFSET NUMBER OF THE TOOL IN THE SPINDLE, DEFAULT THE ACTIVE TOOL. Z GOES TO THE REFERENCE POSITION,)
(THE TOOL OVER THE SETTER AT MACHINE X Y, THEN THE CONTROL'S AUTOMATIC TOOL LENGTH MEASUREMENT G37 SETS THE)
(OFFSET. A ZERO OFFSET, A NEW TOOL, IS FIRST FOUND WITH A SKIP SEARCH ON THE SETTER SIGNAL AT THE FAST FEED)
#30 = #4003
#31 = #{f_var}
#29 = #4008
#28 = #{h_var}
#32 = 1.
IF [#4006 EQ 20] THEN #32 = 25.4
IF [#20 EQ #0] THEN #20 = #4120
IF [#20 LE 0] GOTO 93
G49
G91 G28 Z0
G90 G53 G00 X[{setter_x_mm} / #32] Y[{setter_y_mm} / #32]
#1 = #5023 - #5003
#26 = {setter_z_mm} / #32 - #1
#2 = #[{h_geom} + #20] + #[{h_wear} + #20]
G43 H#20
IF [#2 NE 0] GOTO 10
#3 = #26 - {setter_search_mm} / #32
G31 P{setter_skip} Z#3 F[{fast_feed_mm_min} / #32]
IF [ABS[#5063 - #3] LT {count_mm} / #32] GOTO 95
#[{h_geom} + #20] = #[{h_geom} + #20] + #5063 - #26
N10 G37 Z#26
G91 G28 Z0
G#29 H#28
G#30 F#31
M99
N93 #3000 = {alarm_format} (FORMAT ERROR)
N95 #3000 = {alarm_broken} (BROKEN TOOL)
M99
